OL,3,GNEWSABoy with rare condition being
OL,4,Ahelped by horses
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt the stables in Andreas, she said:
OL,7,F"On the days when he's here he'll be
OL,8,Fmuch happier, he'll be walking a bit
OL,9,Ftaller. It's his confidence as well."
